# Leaderboard UI

Canonical spec: `auction-app/docs/ui-contracts/LEADERBOARD.md`.  
Ops for Match Pos / formation / Best XI publish: `auction-app/docs/OPS_SCORING_AND_LEADERBOARD.md`.

- Three tabs only: Standings, My Points, Competitors.
- My Points and Competitors: one GW dropdown, one GW table. Default = latest GW with scores uploaded.
- Columns: Player, Club, Listed Pos, Match Pos, Score. No named-GW column. No Total on that table.
- Season total: small box on My Points; full table on Standings.
- After Best XI publish: Starting XI + formation + bench (existing `GwSquadTable` / `GameweekSquadView` pattern). Formation needs committed `data/best-xi/auction-{id}-gw{legacyGwId}.json`.
- Missing Match Pos or formation → fix sheets/overlays (ops), not new UI.
- Update the contract in the same change if the user explicitly redesigns this UI.
